#: setup.php
msgid "If the round-trip latency via any of the predefined Cacti ping methods raises above this threshold, log a warning or send email based upon the Devices Criticality and Monitor setting.  The unit is in milliseconds.  Setting to 0 disables. The Thold Plugin is required to leverage this functionality."
msgstr "Ukuba ukulibaziseka kokuhamba nokubuya ngeendlela ze-ping ze-Cacti ezichazwe kwangaphambili kunyuka ngaphezulu kwalo mda, loga isilumkiso okanye uthumele i-imeyile ngokusekelwe kuBubaluleki beZixhobo kunye nesetingi yoMonitha. Iyunithi ikwii-milliseconds. Ukucwangcisa ku-0 kuyacima. I-Thold Plugin iyafuneka ukuze usebenzise lo msebenzi."

