#: setup.php
msgid "If the round-trip latency via any of the predefined Cacti ping methods raises above this threshold, log an alert or send an email based upon the Devices Criticality and Monitor setting.  The unit is in milliseconds.  Setting to 0 disables. The Thold Plugin is required to leverage this functionality."
msgstr "Ukuba ukulibaziseka kokuhamba nokubuya ngeendlela ze-ping ze-Cacti ezichazwe kwangaphambili kunyuka ngaphezulu kwalo mda, loga i-alert okanye uthumele i-imeyile ngokusekelwe kuBubaluleki beZixhobo kunye nesetingi yoMonitha. Iyunithi ikwii-milliseconds. Ukucwangcisa ku-0 kuyacima. I-Thold Plugin iyafuneka ukuze usebenzise lo msebenzi."

